  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the System for Region-wide Disaster Risk Reduction in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects overall objective is to support five Central Asian countries in strengthening disaster resilience at both regional and national levels, with a focus on enhancing disaster coordination and improving earthquake awareness and readiness. It will specifically aim to strengthen regional coordination through the Regional Emergency Response Coordination Mechanism, ensuring a more operational and effective approach to preparedness, response, and recovery during large-scale transboundary dis</narrative>
  </description>
